{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund free NHS embryo & egg freezing for endometriosis patients",
        "additional_details": "For many people, having a family is one of life's greatest hopes. Endometriosis can damage fertility, leaving patients to face painful treatment while fearing they may lose the chance to become parents. We call on the UK Government to fund the provision of free and fair access on the NHS to egg and embryo freezing for endometriosis patients, so decisions are based on clinical need, not where someone lives or what they can afford.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to fund free egg and embryo freezing on the NHS for people with endometriosis who are at risk of infertility. We believe no one should lose the chance to have a family due to this condition or be denied treatment based on where they live or what they can afford.",
